 "equipment_type": "Heat pump / chiller Modbus interface",
 "applies_to": "RTD-W on the P1/P2 bus with a BRC21 controller as main: Daikin Altherma HT hydroboxes, small inverter chillers EWA/YQ16..64 and the heating-only VRV hydrobox; up to 16 units as one group. Instructions 20670-1.07.12.",
 "summary": "Small Modbus RTU slave that joins the P1/P2 bus of Daikin Altherma HT hydroboxes and small inverter chillers. Holding registers set leaving-water and room setpoints, mode, on/off, domestic hot water and quiet mode; input registers return group status, temperatures x100, pump and compressor state, run hours and per-PCB data.",
 "transport": [
  "RTU"
 ],
